{"id":"2e8e6cd022ad4f84","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno.md","title":"Theorem — 保终对象的左伴随保持自然数对象","display":"Theorem — 保终对象的左伴随保持自然数对象","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno","aliases":["14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno"],"display":"Theorem — 保终对象的左伴随保持自然数对象","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"],"source_location":"VI.1, printed 269, equations (4)–(5); DjVu 140","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 保终对象的左伴随保持自然数对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI.1, printed 269, equations (4)–(5); DjVu 140"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；以下范畴及 Hom 集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，分别指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathcal E},1_{\\mathcal F}\">\\(1_{\\mathcal E},1_{\\mathcal F}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span> 左伴随于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(R:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>）。给定同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to L(1_{\\mathcal E})\">\\(c:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to L(1_{\\mathcal E})\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的自然数对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal F}\\bigl(L(N),L(z)\\circ c,L(s)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal F}\\bigl(L(N),L(z)\\circ c,L(s)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to X\">\\(a:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:X\\to X\">\\(h:X\\to X\\)</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a c^{-1}:L1_{\\mathcal E}\\to X\">\\(a c^{-1}:L1_{\\mathcal E}\\to X\\)</span> 沿伴随转置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a:1_{\\mathcal E}\\to RX\">\\(\\bar a:1_{\\mathcal E}\\to RX\\)</span>；以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rh\">\\(Rh\\)</span> 为步进，得到唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:N\\to RX\">\\(v:N\\to RX\\)</span>。由伴随双射得到唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:LN\\to X\">\\(u:LN\\to X\\)</span>。该双射对源和靶自然，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v z=\\bar a\">\\(v z=\\bar a\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uLz=a c^{-1}\">\\(uLz=a c^{-1}\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uLz c=a\">\\(uLz c=a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v s=Rh v\">\\(v s=Rh v\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uLs=hu\">\\(uLs=hu\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"LN\">\\(LN\\)</span> 满足精确 NNO 泛性质。此结果只要求给出的左伴随和终对象比较同构，不要求额外声称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 保全部有限极限。</p>\n<p>原稿记录曾读取原书本地 DjVu OCR，并目视核对 DjVu 140 的印刷页 268–269；以下证明为笔记内展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F$ 为初等拓扑斯，分别指定终对象 $1_{\\mathcal E},1_{\\mathcal F}$。$L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F$ 左伴随于 $R:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$（[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]）。给定同构 $c:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to L(1_{\\mathcal E})$（[[14-df-isomorphism]]）。$(N,z,s)$ 是 $\\mathcal E$ 的自然数对象。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F$ 为初等拓扑斯，分别指定终对象 $1_{\\mathcal E},1_{\\mathcal F}$。$L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F$ 左伴随于 $R:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$（[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]）。给定同构 $c:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to L(1_{\\mathcal E})$（[[14-df-isomorphism]]）。$(N,z,s)$ 是 $\\mathcal E$ 的自然数对象。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E,\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathcal E},1_{\\mathcal F}","display":false},{"tex":"L:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"R:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"c:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to L(1_{\\mathcal E})","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal F}\\bigl(L(N),L(z)\\circ c,L(s)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"a:1_{\\mathcal F}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"h:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"a c^{-1}:L1_{\\mathcal E}\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a:1_{\\mathcal E}\\to RX","display":false},{"tex":"Rh","display":false},{"tex":"v:N\\to RX","display":false},{"tex":"u:LN\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"v z=\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"uLz=a c^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"uLz c=a","display":false},{"tex":"v s=Rh v","display":false},{"tex":"uLs=hu","display":false},{"tex":"LN","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1952,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno|thm-258 — 保终对象的左伴随保持自然数对象]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno|thm-258 — 保终对象的左伴随保持自然数对象]]"},{"id":"c54d379516c87001","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"也可用 [[14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction]] 的常层—全局截面伴随以及 [[14-thm-left-adjoint-preserves-nno]] 得到相同结论。原笔记定位：VI.1，pp.269–270；VI.8，p.319。"}],"outgoing":["8ee22b56cc1189dc","d2b4e5cf16585f95","d5f547b903550705"]}